{"id":"n62265-1-7","stage":1,"title":"꺼내다 · 拿出","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62265-1-7-1","ko":"책상 위에 책을 둔 게 맞아?","zh":"书是放在桌子上的对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둔","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞아?","meaning":"对，中","explanation":"맞다：对，中；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"比某基准更高的一方；或指比中间更高的一方。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对，中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"言语、六感或事实等没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d41e5c9f67b4ed0c1ba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62265-1-7-2","ko":"응. 가방에서 꺼내서 책상에 올려놓았어.","zh":"对。我从包里拿出来，然后放在桌子上了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가방에서","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꺼내서","meaning":"拿出，掏出，取出","explanation":"꺼내다：拿出，掏出，取出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"꺼내다","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62265","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책상에","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올려놓았어.","meaning":"放上","explanation":"올려놓다：放上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"올려놓다","audio":"/audio/d824a6970d16289c5aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62353","senseId":"1","lemma":"올려놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"eda7321c0e7ec22a","term":"꺼내다","zh":"拿出，掏出，取出","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3","entryId":"62265","definition":"把里面的东西拿到外面。","pronunciation":["꺼ː내다"]},{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"d824a6970d16289c","term":"올려놓다","zh":"放上","audio":"/audio/d824a6970d16289c5aa8.mp3","entryId":"62353","definition":"将某个东西拿来搁在某物的上方。","pronunciation":["올려노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/90cd2dd8902c884c384c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62265","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.6301,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["书是放在桌子上的对吧？","对。我从包里拿出来，然后放在桌子上了。","就算吃了药，咳嗽还是没停啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["书是放在桌子上的对吧？","对。我从包里拿出来，然后放在桌子上了。","就算吃了药，咳嗽还是没停啊。"],"answer":1}]}
